        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Eze 2:8—3:3\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo dwondi ŋata nende awinjo ka luwo i polo oluwo kodan kendo munyo waco ni, “Kidhi ikwany kitawo m'oyaw manitie i cingi malaika m'ocungo wi nam kodi wi lowo no.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo akidho bongi malaika no t'akwayo go ni womiyan kitawo mathin no. Go owaco ran ni, “Kwany icami, bino daŋo iyin, to i dhokin bino bedo mamit pa mo kic.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwanyo papila no t'acamo to bedo mamit i dhokan pa mo kic, to munyo acowo mwonyo, odaŋo iyan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
